  <ferc:NotesToFinancialStatementsTextBlock id="Tag198" contextRef="C1">&lt;div&gt;&lt;p&gt;In 2026, the Company collected amounts from shippers related to the vacated Rehearing Order, 178 FERC 61,023. As a result, the adjustment is considered distortive to current year operating revenue and has been recorded to Account 645, Unusual or Infrequent Items (Credit) in the amount of $73,782.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</ferc:NotesToFinancialStatementsTextBlock>
